+# Currency — the facts from outside the compiler tree this plan rests on
+
+One row per standard, kernel fact, reference implementation, test-vector set and outside tool the plan names, with
+the version pinned, the day it was checked, the primary source, and the decision that pins it (the workbench
+research skill's §7). **A row unchecked for six months is stale, and a cycle whose rows are unchecked is not ready to
+start**: each row not yet checked names the cycle that checks it, before that cycle starts. Facts about the language
+are never rows here; they are read in the compiler's tree at the pinned commit. Created by cycle 0.0.1 (@@PD-168@@).
+
